  "solution": "Given: '×' = '+', '+' = '-', '-' = '÷', '÷' = '×'\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/a45b5b9191c13cd4da310eb8df100becb078c240f4b0e763420ec154fb42a5fd.png] \n\n⇒ 8 - 2 ÷ 2 + 2 = 10\n\nApplying '×' = '+', '+' = '-', '-' = '÷', '÷' = '×'\n\n⇒ **8 ÷ 2 **× 2 - 2 = 6\n\n⇒ **4**** × 2 **- 2 = 6\n\n⇒ 8 - 2 = 6\n\n**⇒ 6 = 6**\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"Option 3\"**",
